  "description": "They say less is more. In the case of Garden City, this is especially true. It’s also the joy associated with the freedom of cycling distilled to one single gear. However, don’t let its simplicity fool you, Garden City is more than it seems. A burgeoning velodrome champion? Yes. Urban commuter? Absolutely. Off-season trainer? It worked for Coppi! A contemporary version of the multifaceted fixie, Garden City is as much a track bike as it is anything you want it to be. The supple yet responsive triple butted frameset easily clears a 28c tire. Drilled for bottles and brakes, it's ready for more than just a cross town commute. With no restriction on how you build it or ride it, Garden City is testament to less really being more.",
